      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shame you feel is a heavy cloak, but it's also a very real, very powerful thing. Instead of trying to face the judgment of others, which is exhausting, you could find a quiet, immediate way to just make it through the next hour. Think about the relief of just letting go of the performance you've been putting on for everyone else. A single, small act of self-caring—even something as simple as a deep breath—is a start toward finding that quiet.",
